    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Medic of the Wastes</h2><p><em>Out here, healing is logistics.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You gain a skill rank in Faith (Soul). If you already have it, its rank rises by one instead.</p><p>When you use a medkit to stabilize a creature, it also regains Integrity equal to your rank bonus.</p><p>Additionally, during a Scene Break, you may allow up to two creatures to regain additional Integrity equal to your rank bonus. A creature can benefit from this principle only once per Scene Break.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ +1 Faith. 🃏 Card — shows the Integrity numbers.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
